   1               / Disassembly of the DMS RF08 driver.
   2               / Nov 20 2023:
   3               /       Downloaded the excellent start made by Dave R. from
   4               /       https://forum.vcfed.org/index.php?attachments/dms-stuff-zip.1268325/
   5               / Nov 21 2023:
   6               /       Created this document, which hopes to still document things while
   7               /       actually assembling to re-create the original driver.
   8               /
